0..75 Comment "// A dependent case over the circle owes the transport of its answer at the"
76..143 Comment "// point along the loop, through each endpoint\'s maps: a map of any"
144..220 Comment "// arity whose one argument the point runs through, a loop arm answering the"
221..298 Comment "// loop by its name, and the definitions those maps call, unfolded within the"
299..373 Comment "// obligation\'s budget, as the HoTT book\'s Lemma 6.2.5 states the circle\'s"
374..450 Comment "// dependent elimination: an answer at the point and a path over the loop. A"
451..527 Comment "// row the tree refuses states the refusal it meets and the issue that holds"
528..534 Comment "// it."
535..537 Comment "//"
